  "label": "Visual Metaphor",
  "description": "A visual metaphor is a figure of speech that uses imagery to represent an abstract idea or concept. The image of a man walking up stairs into the clouds is a visual metaphor for ascension or escape, which is used in the meme to suggest that Booth is delusional or dishonest about Lincoln's death.",
